WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:01,220
They just caused trouble

2
00:00:01,540 --> 00:00:03,660
Now the town is relying on the confidence I gave you.

3
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:05,920
I'm afraid they won't be able to hold on if I really leave.

4
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,440
It's time for me to rest my bones.

5
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:11,850
It took ten days

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:13,740
The rabbit is equal to the field

7
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:23,840
The deathly energy in their eyes also irritated my benefactor.

8
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:25,760
Are you about to leave?

9
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:27,880
The dead air in their eyes disappeared

10
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:29,620
It seems to have an effect

11
00:00:30,250 --> 00:00:31,690
I can leave with peace of mind
